BUILDING
========

Make a User Variable 'ANT_LIB' and have it include all the Apache Ant variables.


RUNNING
=======

Rename src/main/xml/user.properties-FillInAndRenameTo-user.properties to
src/main/xml/user.properties and fill in the details.

These are the options:

  -help                        prints help
  -email <String>              set the email to which the message from the translation people goes
  -passwordEmail <String>      password for the email above
  -username <String>           username for launchpad.net
  -password <String>           password for the email above
  -server <String>             mail server to use; defaults to cyrus.limewire.com
  -group <String>              group on launchpad.net -- i.e. the limewire in
                               https://translations.launchpad.net/limewire/trunk/+pots/limewire/ja
                               this allows other folks to use it; defaults to limewire
  -gui                         uses the GUI version 
  
You can see these by passing -help to the main class com.limewire.translations.Main.